# ======================================================================
# ASAS_NAT config — MVPNAT resolution (vertical-first + NAT control logic)
# Used for Phase 2 testing
# ======================================================================
00:00:00.00>plugin load loggerff_asas
00:00:00.00>CDMETHOD STATEBASED
00:00:00.00>RESO MVPNAT
00:00:00.00>ZONER 5
00:00:00.00>ZONEDH 1000
00:00:00.00>DTLOOK 300
00:00:00.00>RFACH 1.05
00:00:00.00>RFACV 1.05
# NAT ceiling margin: buffer below service ceiling [ft]
00:00:00.00>NATCEILMARGIN 500
00:00:00.00>STARTLOG
